    {"symbol": "🍴", "tooltip": "The fork doesn't sever duty from referent — like a recalled drug, it splits one harm into two named defendants: the maker of the part and the operator of the act."},
    {"symbol": "📋", "tooltip": "A training-time model-card spec is a duty fixed before harm; a runtime access log is just a forensic record produced after it."}
  ],
