    {"claim": "A capital reserve secures a check. It binds no competent-professional standard before deployment.", "targets": ["AN-15"]},
    {"claim": "The 2020 study warns directly that the corporate limited-liability model lets human owners hide assets behind an AI entity — and a capital floor without a pre-harm standard is exactly that structure with a price tag.", "targets": ["AN-15"]},
    {"claim": "One weight file splinters into thousands of divergent runtime states, none identical to the model card — the physical-part analogy strains at exactly that seam.", "targets": ["AN-version (Safetyist this round)"]},
    {"claim": "In 2025 the European Union considered a presumption of causality to aid victims of AI harm, and then dropped it — that dropped presumption is the whole game.", "targets": []},
    {"claim": "Who hands the harmed party the discovery rights and the technical access to prove which delegated link authored the trade-off?", "targets": []}
  ]
